}}}}


(* Sales page ****************************************************************)
^page{^T{Sales}}{^empty}{^salesPrimary}{^salesSecondary}{
^cbox{^tbox{^h1{Sales}
^PAR{G1MRA offers member-to-member sales service via our ^link{marketplace}{Marketplace^us^lang.html}, sponsors production of ^link{models}{Models^us^lang.html} and sells ^link{books}{Books^us^lang.html}, ^link{components}{Components^us^lang.html} and G1MRA-branded ^link{merchandise}{Merchandise^us^lang.html}.

We also maintain a classified directory of ^link{suppliers}{Suppliers^us^lang.html} to the Gauge One hobby.

Our own items are priced to cover our costs, not to make a profit, since our members have already paid a subscription. If you are not a member, we do add a surcharge to each item. Some services such as the marketplace are only available to members.

If you'd like to join us then please see ^link{this page}{Join^us^lang.html} for details.
}}}}

