^book{^T{The Project book - £10.00}}{^T{Beginners often begin with the original meths-ﬁred ‘Project’ for which some parts are available from G1MRA suppliers. 84 pages including full drawings and instructions to build a live-steam, single cylinder LMS ‘4F’ 0-6-0 tender engine.}}{Project.jpg}{Project-preview.pdf}
^book{^T{The Dee Book - £7.50}}{^T{Construction guide and drawings to build a live-steam SR ‘D’ class twin inside cylinder tender engine. 96 pages including full drawings and }}{Dee.jpg}{Dee-preview.pdf}
^book{^T{The Dee Metric Drawings - £5.00}}{^T{The Dee book uses UK imperial measurements - this book provides metric eqivalents}}{Dee-metric.png}{Dee-metric.png}

^book{ARM1G - ^T{the other way round} - £7.50}{^T{The ARM1G is a live-steam working model that involves very little engineering and is simple to run. 70 pages including full drawings and instructions to build a twin cylinder 0-4-4T.}}{ARM1G.jpg}{ARMIG-preview.pdf}
^book{^T{The Multipurpose Model Steam Turbine a guide to successful scratch building} - £10.00}{Werner Jeggli, ^T{a member of the Swiss Group, has built four Gauge 1 turbine locos.  This book tells you how to build yours.}}{Turbine.jpg}{Turbine-preview.pdf}
^book{^T{Scratchbuilding the GWR ‘Bulldog’ No. 3343 ‘Camelot’} - £10.00}{^T{This book demonstrates how to build from scratch an electric version of the GWR ‘Bulldog. 92 pages with many coloured photographs and lots of detail.}}{Bulldog.jpg}{Bulldog-preview.pdf}
^book{^T{Modelling in Gauge 1 - Book 2 – JVR’s Contribution to Gauge 1} - £7.50}{^T{Articles and letters by the legendary John van Riemsdijk from more than 200 Newsletters, over 50 years. Many know of his design input to many Aster locomotives. 100 pages including photos and drawings}}{JVR.jpg}{JVR-preview.pdf}
^book{^T{Modelling in Gauge 1 – Book 3 – Freight Stock} - £7.50}{^T{A compilation of articles on freight stock building from NL&Js between 1963 and 2007. 96 pages.}}{Freight.jpg}{Freight-preview.pdf}
^book{^T{Modelling in Gauge 1 – Book 4 – Coaching Stock} - £7.50}{^T{A compilation of articles on coaching stock construction from NL&Js between 1963 and 2008. 102 pages.}}{Coaches.jpg}{Coaches-preview.pdf}
^book{^T{Modelling in Gauge 1 – Book 5 – Coal Firing} - £10.00}{^T{Notes on coal-ﬁring and 14 articles based on practical experiences. Many chapters inspired by the GIMRA Swiss Group. 82 pages with colour photos.}}{Coal.jpg}{Coal-preview.pdf}
^book{^T{A Pictorial History of G1MRA 1947 – 2022} - £35.00}{A hardcover, 163 page, celebration of G1MRA’s 75th Anniversary. A glorious selection of photographs from the G1MRA archives, showing garden get-togethers and exhibitions between 1947 and 2022.}{Pictorial-history.jpg}{Pictorial-history-preview.pdf}

^book{^T{Binder for the Newsletter and Journal - £12.00}}{A ring binder for up to 12 issues of the NLJ complete with plastic inserts - you do not need to punch holes!}{Binder.jpg}{Binder.jpg}
