^page{^T{Components}}{^empty}{^salesPrimary}{^componentsSecondary}{^cbox{^tbox{
^h1{Consumables and components for scratch builders}

^PAR{^T{To order consumables and components, please fill in} ^link{^bf{^T{this form}}}{^componentOrderForm}. ^T{Payment may be made by direct bank transfer or by PayPal (with a £2.00 supplement to cover PayPal fees); account details are on the form. 

^cbox{^bf{Items on this page are only available to members.}}


^hrule
^h1{Ceramic wick}
^hrule

Meths-fired live steam engine performance depends critically on wick condition and geometry. Traditionally asbestos cord was used, but this brings severe health risks from released particles and is strongly deprecated. Ceramic chord is the prefered modern wick material, which we offer for £3 per metre.

In use, cut to length and comb out the chord. Fill burner cups so that the wick is just tight enough to not fall out when the engine in inverted, but no tighter.

^hrule
^h1{Wheel and axle sets}
^hrule
^component{#13 Coach wheel set - £9.50 (P&P for 1-8 sets £4.00; for 9-16 sets £6.00)}{Two steel disc wheels, 35mm diameter over treads, fixed to axle with 40mm back to back, profiled to G1MRA standard}{comp_13.jpg}
^component{#16 Wagon wheel set - £9.50 (P&P for 1-8 sets £4.00; for 9-16 sets £6.00)}{Two steel disc wheels with three holes, 30.5mm diameter over treads, fixed to axle with 40mm back to back, profiled to G1MRA standard}{comp_16.jpg}
^hrule
^h1{White metal castings}
^hrule
^component{#18 RCH wagon axle guard (grease axle box) - £0.75 each (P&P £4.00 per 8 castings)}{Axle guard for Railway Clearing House 1923 style wagons with grease-filled axle boxes. Can be drilled out for a bearing, but will not accomodate springing.}{comp_18.jpg}
^component{#4 RCH wagon axle guard (oil axle box) - £0.75 each (P&P £4.00 per 8 castings)}{Axle guard for Railway Clearing House 1923 style wagons with oil-filled axle boxes. Can be drilled out for a bearing, but will not accomodate springing.}{comp_4.jpg}
^component{#5 Coach axle guard - £1.60 each (P&P £4.00 per 8 castings)}{Axle guard for non-bogie coaches. Can be drilled out for a bearing, but will not accomodate springing.}{comp_5.jpg}
^component{#6 Tender axle guard - £0.75 each (P&P £4.00 per 8 castings)}{Axle guard for tenders. Can be drilled out for a bearing, but will not accomodate springing.}{comp_6.jpg}
^component{#7 LMS bogie coach axle guard - £0.80 each (P&P £4.00 per 8 castings)}{Axle guard for LMS style bogie coaches. Can be drilled out for a bearing, but will not accomodate springing.}{comp_7.jpg}
^component{#9 LNWR bogie coach axle guard - £0.80 each (P&P £4.00 per 8 castings)}{Axle guard for LNWR style bogie coaches. Can be drilled out for a bearing, but will not accomodate springing.}{comp_9.jpg}
