^page{^T{Merchandise}}{^empty}{^salesPrimary}{^merchandiseSecondary}{^cbox{^tbox{
^PAR{
^h1{G1MRA branded merchandise}

^T{To order merchandise, please fill in} ^link{^bf{^T{this form}}}{^merchandiseOrderForm}. ^T{Payment may be made by direct bank transfer or by PayPal (with a £2.00 supplement to cover PayPal fees); account details are on the form. 

^cbox{^bf{Items on this page are only available to members.}}

^hrule
^h1{G1MRA 75th anniversary glasses - £1.50 each - collection at shows only}
^imageBar{^image{g1mraGlass1.jpg}{G1MRA anniversary glass}}{^image{g1mraGlass2.jpg}{G1MRA anniversary glass}}{^image{g1mraGlass3.jpg}{G1MRA anniversary glass}}

These very nice one pint glasses were engraved for the 75th anniversary. We still have significant stocks, hence the low price. They are too fragile to ship economically, so please collect from a show or email ^g1mail{web} to see if we can find a member near you who can collect for you.

^hrule
^h1{Classic design garments}
^cbox{^image{classicFleece1.png}{Classic garment design}}

Green with classic G1MRA logo and no personalisation. Available as a fleece, sweatshirt, polo shirt and Tee shirt. 

Limited quantities are still available in these styles and sizes only:

Fleece @ £15.00 each - medium

Sweatshirt @ £10.00 each - XXL and small

Polo shirt @ £10.00 each - small

Tee shirt @ £6.00 each - XL, large and small

UK post and packing is £4.00 per two items, or collect from a show.

^hrule
^h1{New style garments}
^imageBar{^image{newFleece1.png}{New style garment}}{^image{newFleece2.png}{New style garment}}{^image{newFleece3.png}{New style garment}}

The G1MRA Midland Group have worked with a local supplier to provide personalised garments featuring the G1MRA wheel logo, a group affiliation and a name. As shown above, the Surrey Group used the same supplier; they provide a very wide range of garments and colours at reasonable prices.

If you are part of a G1MRA group that would like to provide garments for your members, please email ^g1mail{web} for more information.

^hrule
^h1{G1MRA lapel badge - £1.00 each}
^cbox{^image{G1MRABadge.png}{G1MRA lapel badge}}

^hrule
}}
